sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant UI as Admin Web
    participant API as Firmware API
    participant FS as Firmware Service
    participant Storage as Firmware Storage
    participant DB as Database
    actor QA
    actor Admin

    Dev->>UI: Upload firmware + metadata + SHA-256
    UI->>API: POST /api/firmware
    API->>API: Authenticate & check DEVELOPER role
    API->>FS: Validate firmware

    FS->>FS: Calculate SHA-256 from file
    FS->>FS: Validate checksum and model

    alt Invalid checksum or unsupported model
        FS-->>API: Validation failed
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
        UI-->>Dev: Reject upload
    else Validation successful
        FS->>Storage: Store firmware file
        Storage-->>FS: Return fileUrl

        FS->>DB: INSERT firmware_versions
        Note right of DB: status = UPLOADED<br/>uploadedBy = Dev.id

        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_UPLOADED)
        DB-->>FS: Firmware and audit log saved
        FS-->>API: Upload successful
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>Dev: Waiting for QA approval
    end

    QA->>UI: Review pending firmware
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/firmware/{id}/approve
    API->>API: Authenticate & check QA role
    API->>FS: Approve firmware
    FS->>DB: Get firmware information
    DB-->>FS: uploadedBy, status, model, version

    alt QA is the original uploader
        FS-->>API: Four-eyes rule violation
        API-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
        UI-->>QA: Cannot approve own firmware
    else Firmware is not in UPLOADED state
        FS-->>API: Invalid firmware state
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
        UI-->>QA: Firmware cannot be approved
    else Four-eyes rule satisfied
        FS->>FS: Check uploadedBy != QA.id
        FS->>DB: UPDATE firmware_versions
        Note right of DB: status = APPROVED<br/>approvedBy = QA.id<br/>DB CHECK: uploadedBy != approvedBy

        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_APPROVED)
        DB-->>FS: Transaction committed

        FS-->>API: Approval successful
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>QA: Firmware approved
    end

    Note over API,DB: APPROVED firmware can be selected<br/>for campaigns after compatibility checks

    opt ADMIN deprecates firmware
        Admin->>UI: Deprecate firmware
        UI->>API: PATCH /api/firmware/{id}/deprecate
        API->>API: Authenticate & check ADMIN role
        API->>FS: Deprecate firmware
        FS->>DB: UPDATE firmware_versions
        Note right of DB: status = DEPRECATED
        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_DEPRECATED)
        DB-->>FS: Deprecation saved
        FS-->>API: Deprecation successful
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>Admin: Firmware deprecated
    end